# Deny by default - only allow whitelisted documentation and incident data

*
!.gitignore
!.github/

# Whitelisted documentation files
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!PROJECT_STATE.md
!ROADMAP.md

# Incident management structure
!incidents/
!incidents/**/*.md
!daily-reports/
!daily-reports/**/*.md
!playbooks/
!playbooks/**/*.md
!alert-rules/
!alert-rules/**/*.yaml
!alert-rules/**/*.yml
!statistics/
!statistics/**/*.md
!statistics/**/*.csv
!archive/
!archive/**/*.md

# Original publication files (legacy - deprecated in favor of incidents/)
!ROUTER-SECURITY-AUDIT-LATEST.md
!BASELINE-LATEST.json
!DEVICE-SUMMARY.json
